      </li>
    </ul>

    <ul>
      <li>If the collection is solely for journalistic, artistic, or literary purposes</li>
    </ul>

    <ul>
      <li>If the information is publicly available and is specified by the regulations</li>
    </ul>

    <ul>
      <li>
